==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is an easier difficulty than [[Otherworld Meadow]] of [[Arcane Confluence]], so you should have no problem beating it.

